# Whitelist approach: ~/.claude mixes durable config with live runtime
# state (credentials, session history, caches, daemon sockets...). Default
# to ignoring everything so anything new Claude Code drops in here doesn't
# get committed by accident, and explicitly allow the few files that are
# actually portable config.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!settings.json
!statusline-command.sh
!*.example
